    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Hippocrates walks into town for his teaching without stopping now and keeps up tai chi twice a week. His knees ache only after long walks, at 2 of 10. He has had no falls. He uses the gel a few mornings a week and acetaminophen about once a week. He sleeps well. He would like the second zoster dose and his influenza vaccine today, and to talk about a portable medical order to go with his advance directive. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mobility</td><td>Gait speed 0.96 m/s; Timed Up and Go 10.9 seconds; 11 chair stands; tandem stance 10 seconds</td></tr><tr><td>Knee</td><td>Pain 2 of 10; KOOS JR 76</td></tr><tr><td>Grip</td><td>26 kg right, 24 kg left</td></tr><tr><td>Falls</td><td>None in seven months</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

